 in that theater or in those theaters, maybe also where you think core FINS is internationally?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WDAY 2022 Q3","e":"wday","d":"2021-11-18","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Brad Zelnick","x":"Seeing the growth and total backlog exceeding that of 20 months for a month backlog, we actually had picked up from partners, just in general, beyond even Workday, customers looking to go longer and longer duration in anticipation of inflation and price increases.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WDAY 2022 Q3","e":"wday","d":"2021-11-18","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robynne Sisco","x":"Taking into account these investments, our expectation of COVID -related cost-savings saving out, and the full-year impact of our new bonus program, we continue to expect FY23 non-GAAP operating margins of 18%.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WDAY 2022 Q3","e":"wday","d":"2021-11-18","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Brent Bracelin","x":"You've now had two quarters of accelerating subscription growth, and you're raising the outlook for next year.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WDAY 2022 Q4","e":"wday","d":"2022-02-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Chano Fernandez","x":"I think we've done a nice job of tapping into that market and figuring out a way to rightsize the deployment costs with our launch investments, and we are really well positioned with the broader platform solution.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WDAY 2023 Q1","e":"wday","d":"2022-05-26","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Mark Murphy","x":"Congrats on raising the guidance for the year.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WDAY 2023 Q2","e":"wday","d":"2022-08-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Brent Bracelin","x":"My question here with your focus around cross-sell, what's the narrative around cost savings, vendor consolidation to bundle HCM and FINS.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WDAY 2023 Q2","e":"wday","d":"2022-08-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Brent Bracelin","x":"Love to hear if there's an appetite to further consolidate vendors from a cost savings perspective to bundle HCM and FINS, specifically with some large US customers.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WDAY 2023 Q2","e":"wday","d":"2022-08-25","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Barbara Larson","x":"With that context, we are maintaining our guidance for FY 2023 subscription revenue of $5.537 billion to $5.557 billion, representing 22% year-over-year growth.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WDAY 2023 Q2","e":"wday","d":"2022-08-25","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Barbara Larson","x":"I'll just say, coming off a quarter as strong as Q2, we would have liked to have been able to raise our outlook for the full year.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WDAY 2023 Q4","e":"wday","d":"2023-02-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Aneel Bhusri","x":"Final announcement I want to highlight, which we made at the end of January, was a restructuring and realignment of some teams across Workday that led to the elimination of roles impacting about 3% of our global workforce.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WDAY 2023 Q4","e":"wday","d":"2023-02-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Aneel Bhusri","x":"Throughout this process, we did our absolute best to treat the affected employees with compassion and offer them generous severance packages.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WDAY 2024 Q1","e":"wday","d":"2023-05-25","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Kirk Materne","x":"You guys, as you mentioned, have been investing in AI for a while.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WDAY 2024 Q1","e":"wday","d":"2023-05-25","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Barbara Larson","x":"In addition, we are lowering our guidance for FY '24 capital expenditures to approximately $300 million driven by normalization we are seeing within our supply chain.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WDAY 2024 Q2","e":"wday","d":"2023-08-24","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Kash Rangan","x":"At a high level, how could you possibly monetize with AI, the value of this data in the years ahead, and therefore its implications for the pricing power of Workday?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WDAY 2024 Q3","e":"wday","d":"2023-11-28","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Carl Eschenbach","x":"Another key investment area is around AI, which we've been building into our platform for nearly a decade.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WDAY 2024 Q3","e":"wday","d":"2023-11-28","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Aneel Bhusri","x":"Another way we're infusing generative AI into our platform is through our investment in conversational AI.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WDAY 2024 Q3","e":"wday","d":"2023-11-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Aneel Bhusri","x":"Growing and retaining talent, streamlining business processes and driving better decision making.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WDAY 2025 Q1","e":"wday","d":"2024-05-23","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Carl Eschenbach","x":"With our leadership and investment in AI, our unique ability to address organizations' most critical challenges and the deep relationships we have with our customers and partners, Workday remains well positioned to extend our market leadership.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WDAY 2025 Q1","e":"wday","d":"2024-05-23","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Carl Eschenbach","x":"Because they are not looking to go spend money on another AI platform or some thin veneer solution that says they're AI.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WDAY 2025 Q1","e":"wday","d":"2024-05-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Carl Eschenbach","x":"They did so with the cloud and now they're turning to us to help them responsibly leverage AI to drive productivity, efficiency, and cost savings.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WDAY 2025 Q1","e":"wday","d":"2024-05-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Carl Eschenbach","x":"In Q1, we released a natively built configure price quote solution for services businesses, which integrates with CRM platforms to streamline the quoting process.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WDAY 2025 Q2","e":"wday","d":"2024-08-22","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Zane Rowe","x":"We've looked at both innovation, R&D spend and how AI can actually help those efforts and we've got a terrific team, we're doing a lot of innovating, a lot of building out the product and a lot of growing.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WDAY 2025 Q2","e":"wday","d":"2024-08-22","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Mark Murphy","x":"But then on the other side of the ledger, as you do re-tweak the growth and margin, the midterm target, do you sense any customers pausing to digest application purchases broadly just as they're trying to understand the GPU landscape, the AI landscape at the infrastructure layer?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WDAY 2025 Q3","e":"wday","d":"2024-11-26","l":"theater","r":"analyst","s":"Brad Zelnick","x":"Can you just talk a little bit about what's happening there in that theater?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WDAY 2025 Q3","e":"wday","d":"2024-11-26","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Carl Eschenbach","x":"Our customers know that an investment in Workday is an investment in AI, and we are seeing a ton of excitement and demand for our AI solutions.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WDAY 2025 Q3","e":"wday","d":"2024-11-26","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Carl Eschenbach","x":"It’s clear that customers are ready to invest in AI that's built for their specific needs and delivers real results.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WDAY 2025 Q3","e":"wday","d":"2024-11-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Carl Eschenbach","x":"We plan to achieve this by continuing to innovate and take share in our core markets, while also streamlining operations across the company.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WDAY 2025 Q4","e":"wday","d":"2025-02-25","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Carl Eschenbach","x":"As more agents are deployed, organizations risk fragmented operations, increased security risk, and difficulty measuring the true value of their AI investments.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WDAY 2025 Q4","e":"wday","d":"2025-02-25","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Zane Rowe","x":"This outlook incorporates an accelerated pace of AI investment across our platform and targeted investments across key areas of the business.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WDAY 2025 Q4","e":"wday","d":"2025-02-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Carl Eschenbach","x":"Our recent restructuring was a tough, but necessary decision that will help us invest in the business to meet our customers' needs.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WDAY 2025 Q4","e":"wday","d":"2025-02-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Zane Rowe","x":"GAAP operating income in the quarter was impacted by a $75 million charge, primarily related to the previously announced restructuring.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WDAY 2025 Q4","e":"wday","d":"2025-02-25","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Kirk Materne","x":"You guys just reiterated guidance, so that infer that, but I was wondering, if you just put a little bit more color around that?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WDAY 2026 Q3","e":"wday","d":"2025-11-25","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Zane Rowe","x":"We're optimistic about the AI-driven growth investments we are making and have ample capacity to continue to invest while we drive further efficiencies consistent with the framework from our Financial Analyst Day.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/25/workday-wday-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WDAY 2026 Q3","e":"wday","d":"2025-11-25","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Zane Rowe","x":"We continue to invest in AI.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/25/workday-wday-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WDAY 2026 Q3","e":"wday","d":"2025-11-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Carl Eschenbach","x":"So while there are some layoffs out there, we're still growing headcount across our customer base.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/25/workday-wday-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WDAY 2026 Q3","e":"wday","d":"2025-11-25","l":"ai_disruption","r":"analyst","s":"Carl Eschenbach","x":"When he talked about all of this potential disruption coming from these AI startups to more mature and larger SaaS companies like Workday.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/25/workday-wday-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WDAY 2026 Q3","e":"wday","d":"2025-11-25","l":"ai_disruption","r":"analyst","s":"Kash Rangan","x":"And I agree with you that AI disruption risk seems to be a little overstated.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/25/workday-wday-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WDAY 2027 Q1","e":"wday","d":"2026-05-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Zane C. Rowe","x":"As Aneel mentioned, we are streamlining how we operate the business and are focused on investing in areas with the highest returns.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/21/workday-wday-q1-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WDAY 2027 Q1","e":"wday","d":"2026-05-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Gerrit Kazmaier","x":"…which basically has a scope of workday and an implementation method that allowed us to super streamline it Now deployment agent is actually now applying a AI to automate that entire process. it is the next logical step if you think about it from improving that method further to make it AI…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/21/workday-wday-q1-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WDAY 2027 Q1","e":"wday","d":"2026-05-21","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"Aneel Bhusri","x":"While there are some who believe that AI can disrupt Workday, I see something different.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/21/workday-wday-q1-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WDAY 2027 Q1","e":"wday","d":"2026-05-21","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"Aneel Bhusri","x":"Our chance to once again be a disruptor with AI clearly driving that disruption.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/21/workday-wday-q1-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[37,1,7602,0,0,0,5281,1849],[38,1,6989,0,0,0,4518,